4.m:
The other two [formulas for] shaving, however, are:
'With which Pūṣan shaved for the life of Bṛhaspati, Agni, and Indra, / with that I shave thee, for life, for longevity, for welfare,' / at the back;
'Whereby this one may walk further and long see the sun, / with that I shave thee, for life, for longevity, for renown, for high luster,' / on the north.
